different strategies which can be made to work.  I've had the
most success with fighter classes, two weaponing, GDSM, robe and
AoR.  But I adapt my strategy according to what the RGN gives
me: if the only dragon which drops scales is silver, I'll go
that way, and if the character the RGN gives me can't two
weapon, obviously, a shield of reflection is the way to go
(assuming I get one---in my current game, my healer hasn't seen
